Thus the left-hand side of the target is rewritten as this entropy expression.

Project the identically-distributed pairs to obtain $X\sim X'$ and $Y\sim Y'$. Rewrite the right-hand side using `IdentDistrib.rdist_congr` to replace $d[X;\mu\#Y;\mu']$ by $d[X';
u\#Y';
